      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's incredibly heavy and definitely captures that dark atmosphere. To make the scene even more impactful, could we expand on the landowner's monologue? I want to show how he justifies his worldview to himself—maybe he explains why he thinks this hierarchy is the natural order of things or why he feels justified in treating James this way. It would help illustrate the systemic mindset of the era.",
